WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:06.800
Only the hard and strong may call themselves Spartans.

00:07.000 --> 00:09.500
Only the hard.

00:28.000 --> 00:30.500
Only the strong.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.000
We march. For our lands, for our families,

00:45.200 --> 00:49.000
for our freedoms. We march.

00:50.000 --> 00:53.000
Leonidas! What a pleasant surprise.

00:57.500 --> 00:59.800
This morning's full of surprises.

01:00.000 --> 01:02.200
We've been tricked. Can't be more than a few hundred.

01:02.400 --> 01:04.000
This is a surprise.

01:04.200 --> 01:05.200
Silence!

01:05.400 --> 01:10.500
We heard Sparta was on the warpath, and we were eager to join forces.

01:11.000 --> 01:14.500
If it is blood you seek, you're welcome to join us.

01:14.700 --> 01:18.500
But you bring only this handful of soldiers against Xerxes?

01:18.700 --> 01:23.500
I see I was wrong to expect Sparta's commitment to at least match our own.

01:23.700 --> 01:25.000
Doesn't it?

01:25.500 --> 01:28.500
You there! What is your profession?

01:29.000 --> 01:31.000
I'm a potter... sir.

01:32.000 --> 01:35.500
And you, Arcadian! What is your profession?

01:36.000 --> 01:38.200
Sculptor, sir.

01:38.400 --> 01:39.800
Sculptor.

01:41.000 --> 01:42.500
And you?

01:43.500 --> 01:46.500
Blacksmith.

01:48.000 --> 01:52.000
Spartans! What is your profession?!

01:52.200 --> 01:57.500
HA-OOH! HA-OOH! HA-OOH!

01:58.000 --> 02:03.000
You see, old friend? I brought more soldiers than you did.
